 "title": "Jivrus Technologies - Data Policy",
 "description": "Purpose The purpose of this policy is to establish guidelines for the retention and protection of Jivrus Technologies' data. Scope This policy applies to all Jivrus Technologies' data, including but not limited to customer data, employee data, financial data, and intellectual property. Data",
